flowchart LR
  subgraph Platform[Existing live application]
    UI[Next.js species report] --> API[FastAPI]
    API --> Resolve[GBIF identity and profile enrichment]
    Resolve --> Sources[IUCN and references and news]
    Sources --> Hybrid[Heuristics plus Ollama plus repair]
    Hybrid --> Draft[Unverified draft for human review]
  end
  subgraph Study[Fixed evidence evaluation]
    Archive[Original artifacts and hashes] --> Audit[Read-only audit]
    Curate[Licensed reviewed India frame] --> Split[Species and genus splits]
    Split --> Mask[Complete partial minimal projections]
    Mask --> Freeze[Frozen protocol and hashes]
    Freeze --> Methods[Original engineered constrained QLoRA template]
    Methods --> Raw[Raw outputs failures timing and seeds]
    Raw --> Checks[Strict schema and structured support checks]
    Raw --> Blind[Blinded claim review and adjudication]
    Checks --> Stats[Paired species and seed resampling]
    Blind --> Stats
    Audit --> Paper[Verified paper material]
    Stats --> Paper
  end
  UI --> Preview[Fixed evidence method preview]
  Preview --> Checks
